Date: Thu, 6 Nov 2025 18:38:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] AOSCOS: fix(meson): drop /.flatpak-info check from
 bottles/frontend/meson.build

Seems pointless.

Link: https://github.com/bottlesdevs/Bottles/issues/4166
Signed-off-by: Mingcong Bai <jeffbai@aosc.io>
---
 bottles/frontend/meson.build | 6 ------
 1 file changed, 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/bottles/frontend/meson.build b/bottles/frontend/meson.build
index 6ff7c011..c26ea0b9 100644
--- a/bottles/frontend/meson.build
+++ b/bottles/frontend/meson.build
@@ -23,12 +23,6 @@ params_file = configure_file(
     configuration: conf
 )
 
-fs = import('fs')
-
-if not fs.is_file('/' + '.flatpak-info')
-  error('file does not exist')
-endif
-
 bottles_sources = [
   '__init__.py',
   'main.py',
